&lt;p&gt;本来想要把之前写的东西往这里迁移一部分，结果发现当初刷系统的时候备份那些
Markdown 的硬盘放学校里了。没办法，改天吧。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry><entry><title>Hello, World</title><link rel="alternate" href="https://lizi.moe/posts/hello-world/"></link><id>https://lizi.moe/posts/hello-world/</id><updated>2026-07-31</updated><category term="getting-started"></category><category term="demo"></category><summary>A sample post showcasing the features of burogu</summary><content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Welcome! This sample post demonstrates what burogu can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;text&quot;&gt;Text&lt;/h2&gt;
