href=&quot;/posts/hello-world/&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;. Bare URLs are linked automatically:
&lt;a href=&quot;https://example.com&quot; class=&quot;uri&quot;&gt;https://example.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
